helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sl	Podpora za Javo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	sl	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Podpora za Javo\"\>Podpora za Javo\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	sl	$[officename] podpira Javo za poganjanje programov in komponent, ki temeljijo na arhitekturi JavaBeans.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	sl	Če želite, da v $[officename] Java deluje, morate namestiti javansko izvajalno okolje. Ko ste namestili $[officename], ste imeli v primeru namestitvenega paketa z JRE možnost samodejne namestitve teh datotek, če le-te še niso bile nameščene. Prav tako lahko namestite te datoteke zdaj, če je potrebno.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	sl	Če želite poganjati javanske programe, morate v $[officename] aktivirati Javo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	sl	Javo aktivirate z izbiro \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Nastavitve\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Orodja - Možnosti\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Java\"\>$[officename] - Java\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	sl	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	sl	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sl	$[officename] in internet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	sl	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0800.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] in internet\"\>$[officename] in internet\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0800.xhp	0	help	par_id3155150				0	sl	Tu najdete informacije na temo spleta. \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Spletni slovarček\"\>Spletni slovarček\</link\> razloži najpogostejše pojme.				20200411 15:09:53
