helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	sl	Izračuna logično ekvivalenco dveh izrazov.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154367				0	sl	Skladnja:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	sl	Rezultat= Izraz1 Eqv Izraz2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151043				0	sl	Parametri:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	sl	\<emph\>Rezultat:\</emph\> Poljubna numerična spremenljivka, ki shrani rezultat kombinacije.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	sl	\<emph\>Izraz1, Izraz2:\</emph\>Poljubna izraza, ki ju želite povezati.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	sl	Pri preizkusu ekvivalence dveh logičnih izrazov je rezultat \<emph\>Res\</emph\> v primeru, če sta oba izraza ali \<emph\>Res\</emph\> ali pa \<emph\>Ni res\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	sl	V primerjavi po bitih bo operator Eqv ustrezni bit postavil v primeru, da je bit postavljen v obeh izrazih ali pa v nobenem od njiju.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159154				0	sl	Primer:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	sl	Sub PrimerZaEqv				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155308				0	sl	Dim A as Variant, B as Variant, C as Variant, D as Variant				20200411 15:09:53
