helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143270				0	sl	Vrnjena vrednost:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147530				0	sl	String				20200411 15:09:53
