helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	sl	V vrstici \<emph\>Oblikovanje\</emph\> kliknite ikono \<emph\>Poudarjanje\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
