helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	sl	Hiperpovezave na katerikoli dokument ali cilje v dokumentih se lahko urejajo z uporabo jezička \<emph\>Dokument\</emph\> v \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Pogovorno okno Hiperpovezava\"\>pogovornem oknu Hiperpovezava\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150808				0	sl	Dokument				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150710				0	sl	Pot				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id9462263				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Vnesite URL datoteke, ki jo želite odpreti s klikom hiperpovezave. Če ne navedete ciljnega okvira, se datoteka odpre v trenutnem dokumentu ali okviru.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136				0	sl	Odpri datoteko				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095	7			0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_DOCUMENT:BTN_FILEOPEN\"\>Odpre \<emph\>pogovorno okno Odpri,\</emph\> kjer lahko izberete datoteko.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149828				0	sl	Cilj v dokumentu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145071				0	sl	Cilj				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_DOCUMENT:ED_TARGET_DOC\"\>Določa cilj hiperpovezave v dokumentu, navedenem v polju \<emph\>Pot\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
