helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FileControl\"\>Ustvari gumb, ki omogoča izbor datotek.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
