helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000406.xhp	0	help	par_id3146765				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Orodja - Galerija\</emph\> ali pa v vrstici \<emph\>Standardno\</emph\> kliknite				20200411 15:09:53
