helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\print_blackwhite.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147653				0	sl	Črno-belo tiskanje v modulih \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNME\</item\> Impress in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNME\</item\> Draw				20200411 15:09:53
