helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	sl	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	sl	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog to change toolbars, menus and other user interface items.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	sl	Spreminjate lahko elemente menijske vrstice. Elemente lahko brišete, dodajate nove, jih kopirate iz enega menija v drugega, jih preimenujete ipd.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	sl	Orodne vrstice lahko prosto prilagajate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	sl	Spreminjate lahko tipke za bližnjice.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3153345				0	sl	You can change default settings of $[officename] to suit your needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	optid3155421				0	sl	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/010000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> dialog to change a variety of settings you will use in $[officename] modules. Items presented in the \<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\> menu will change depending on the module you are using.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3145071				0	sl	In \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find options for your default language and currency setting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3149811				0	sl	In \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] Writer - Basic Fonts\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find default font settings. Change these to suit your preferences. Fonts can easily be changed on per document basis.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3150443				0	sl	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010900.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Print\</emph\>\</link\> contains a number of print customizations that may be useful for your particular needs.				20200411 15:09:53
