helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	sl	Na zavihku \<emph\>Orodne vrstice\</emph\> kliknite puščico navzdol in novo ikono postavite na želeno mesto. Kliknite \<emph\>V redu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
