helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10930				0	sl	Pritisnite \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C.				20200411 15:09:53
