helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000110.xhp	0	help	par_idN10906				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\"sfx2:ComboBox:RID_DLG_SEARCH:ED_SEARCH\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Vnesite besedilo, ki ga želite najti ali izberite vnos besedila s seznama.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
