helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_LISTBOX_RID_SCPAGE_LAYOUT_LB_ALIGN\"\>Določa smer, v katero se bo kazalka v preglednici premaknila po pritisku na tipko Enter.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
