helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010203.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342	16			0	sl	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"SW:CHECKBOX:TP_LAB_PRT:CB_SYNCHRON\"\>Vam omogoča urejanje ene same nalepke ali vizitke in posodobi vsebino preostalih nalepk ali vizitk na strani, ko kliknete gumb \<emph\>Sinhroniziraj nalepke\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
