helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7594225				0	sl	Kliknite ikono Poročila \<image id=\"img_id4678487\" src=\"dbaccess/res/reports_32.png\" width=\"0.566cm\" height=\"0.566cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id4678487\"\>Ikona\</alt\>\</image\> in dvokliknite nazadnje shranjeno poročilo. Ustvarjen bo nov dokument modula Writer, ki prikazuje nove podatke.				20200411 15:09:53
