helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152901				0	sl	\<variable id=\"sytexttitel\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ToggleTitle\"\>Za vklop ali izklop naslova in podnaslova v vrstici Oblikovanje kliknite \<emph\>Naslov vklopljen/izklopljen\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
