helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147001				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Backward\"\>Pošlje izbrane nize podatkov nazaj (na levo).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
