helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551697				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Vsebina celic je poravnana navpično sredinsko glede na celice.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
