helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153191				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Uredi - Izreži\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3148575				0	sl	Kliknite celico, ki bo na koncu zgornja leva celica.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Uredi - Posebno lepljenje\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	sl	V pogovornem oknu označite \<emph\>Prilepi vse\</emph\> in \<emph\>Transponiraj\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155600				0	sl	Če kliknete V redu, se stolpci in vrstice transponirajo.				20200411 15:09:53
