helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3151116				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Nastavitve\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Orodja - Možnosti\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Pogled\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
