helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id7781914				0	sl	=ISTEXT(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;2)) => FALSE (B1, prej TRUE)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id300912				0	sl	=ISTEXT(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;3)) => FALSE (C1)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id9534592				0	sl	=ISBLANK(B1) => TRUE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4969328				0	sl	=ISBLANK(C1) => FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id9635914				0	sl	=ISBLANK(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;2)) => TRUE (B1, prej FALSE)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id2476577				0	sl	=ISBLANK(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;3)) => FALSE (C1)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4217047				0	sl	Upoštevajte, da se Microsoft Excel vede drugače in vedno vrne številko kot rezultat sklica na prazno celico ali celico formule z rezultatom prazne celice. Primer:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id2629474				0	sl	A1: <prazna>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id8069704				0	sl	B1: =A1 => prikaže 0, vendar je zgolj sklic na prazno celico				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4524674				0	sl	=ISNUMBER(A1) => FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
