helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030400.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147335				0	sl	\<bookmark_value\>celice; odstranjevanje odvisnikov\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147335				0	sl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06030400.xhp\" name=\"Odstrani odvisnike\"\>Odstrani odvisnike\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
