helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151030				0	sl	\<bookmark_value\>funkcija MDETERM\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>determinante\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151030				0	sl	MDETERM				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154073				0	sl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MDET\"\>Vrne determinanto matrike.\</ahelp\> Ta funkcija vrne vrednost v trenutni celici; za rezultat ni potrebno določiti obsega celic.				20200411 15:09:53
