helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371K				0	sl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(12<11;13>22;10)\</item\> returns TRUE since this converts to (1+0+10) mod 2 = 0				20200411 15:09:53
