helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150510				0	sl	Z desnim gumbom na seznamu slogov strani kliknite "Desna stran" in izberite \<emph\>Spremeni\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	sl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> dialog, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	sl	Select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header on\</item\> and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Organizer\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3146865				0	sl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Next Style\</item\> box, select "Left Page".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3146889				0	sl	Kliknite \<emph\>V redu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
