helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150748				0	sl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> dialog, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153172				0	sl	Select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Header on\</item\> and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Organizer\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3147061				0	sl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Next Style\</item\> box, select "Right Page".				20200411 15:09:53
