helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3147126				0	sl	$[officename] lahko samodejno uporabi izmenjujoče sloge strani na sodih (levih) in lihih (desnih) straneh dokumenta. Primer: uporabite lahko sloge strani za prikaz različnih glav in nog na sodih in lihih straneh. Trenutni slog strani se prikaže v \<emph\>Vrstici stanja\</emph\> na dnu delovne površine.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	hd_id8194219				0	sl	Ustvarjanje in uporaba izmenjajočih se slogov strani				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3150526				0	sl	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Styles\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	sl	Na seznamu slogov strani z desnim gumbom kliknite "Leva stran" in izberite \<emph\>Spremeni\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3153179				0	sl	Kliknite zavihek \<emph\>Organizator\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3145267				0	sl	Izberite "Desno stran" v polju \<emph\>Naslednji slog\</emph\> in nato kliknite \<emph\>V redu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3145299				0	sl	Na seznamu slogov strani z desnim gumbom kliknite "Desna stran" in izberite \<emph\>Spremeni\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529				0	sl	Izberite "Levo stran" v polju \<emph\>Naslednji slog\</emph\> in nato kliknite \<emph\>V redu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3155561				0	sl	Pojdite na prvo stran v dokumentu, dvakrat kliknite "Desna stran" na seznamu slogov strani v oknu Slogi in oblikovanje.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3155588				0	sl	To add a header to one of the page styles, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Header\</item\>, and choose the page style that you want to add the header to. In the header frame, type the text that you want to use as the header.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3147772				0	sl	To add a footer to one of the page styles, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Footer\</item\>, and choose the page style that you want to add the footer to. In the footer frame, type the text that you want to use as a footer.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3147254				0	sl	Če ne želite glave ali noge na naslovnici dokumenta, uporabite za naslovnico slog "Prva stran".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	hd_id888698				0	sl	Preprečitev tiskanja praznih strani				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id3394573				0	sl	Če si v dokumentu sledita dve sodi ali dve lihi strani, bo Writer vstavil prazno stran. Za te samodejno ustvarjene prazne strani lahko preprečite tiskanje ali izvoz v PDF.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id7594225				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Nastavitve\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Orodja - Možnosti\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Tiskanje\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\even_odd_sdw.xhp	0	help	par_id8147221				0	sl	Odstranite kljukico s potrditvenega polja \<emph\>Natisni samodejno vstavljene prazne strani\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
