helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155900				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Vstavi - Zapiši\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	sl	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Short name\</item\> box, and then add additional information to the record in the remaining boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219	66			0	sl	Close the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Bibliography Database\</item\> window. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150242				0	sl	Kako shranite bibliografske podatke v samostojnem dokumentu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150945				0	sl	V dokumentu kliknite na mesto, kamor želite dodati bibliografski vnos.				20200411 15:09:53
