helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153738				0	sl	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Short name\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153763				0	sl	Select the publication source for the record in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box, and then add additional information in the remaining boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3146873				0	sl	Kliknite \<emph\>V redu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3146897				0	sl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert Bibliography Entry\</item\> dialog, click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>, and then \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
