helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3148421				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Vstavi - Kazala vsebine - Bibliografski vnos\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153231				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Iz bibliografske zbirke podatkov\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147059				0	sl	Select the name of the bibliography entry that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Short name\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085				0	sl	Kliknite \<emph\>Vstavi\</emph\> in nato še \<emph\>Zapri\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
