helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	sl	To quickly insert a hyphen, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Hyphen(-).				20200411 15:09:53
