helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Oblika - Slika\</emph\> in kliknite zavihek \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060200.xhp\" name=\"Oblivanje\"\>\<emph\>Oblivanje\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153370				0	sl	Nastavite vse želene možnosti.				20200411 15:09:53
