helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154247				0	sl	Kako spremenite oblivanje obrisa grafike				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	sl	Spremenite lahko obliko oblivanja besedila.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3154860				0	sl	Izberite grafiko, kliknite z desnim gumbom in izberite \<emph\>Oblivanje - Uredi obris\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3150231				0	sl	Use the tools to draw a new contour, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Apply\</item\> icon (green check mark).				20200411 15:09:53
