helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150969				0	sl	Ciljni okvir je prazen.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	sl	Ciljni okvir ni povezan z drugim okvirom.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154383				0	sl	Izvorni in ciljni okvir se nahajata v istem odseku. Primer: ne morete povezati okvira glave z okvirom noge.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3145559				0	sl	Izvorni okvir nima naslednje povezave.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3145577				0	sl	Izvorni in ciljni okvir nista eden v drugem.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3151083				0	sl	Ko izberete povezani okvir, se pokaže črta, ki povezuje okvire.				20200411 15:09:53
