helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917				0	sl	Izberite besedilo, ki ga želite nadpisati ali podpisati.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3155865				0	sl	Naredite nekaj od naslednjega:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Oblika - Znak - Položaj\</emph\> in izberite \<emph\>Nadpisano\</emph\> ali \<emph\>Podpisano\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3156111				0	sl	Pritisnite \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+P, če želite nadpisano besedilo, in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+B, če želite podpisano besedilo.				20200411 15:09:53
