helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printing_order.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	sl	Kliknite zavihek \<emph\>Možnosti\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\printing_order.xhp	0	help	par_id3156106				0	sl	Izberite \<emph\>Tiskanje v obratnem vrstnem redu\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
