helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	sl	Za urejanje vnosa v kazalo postavite kazalko pred poljem kazala in nato izberite\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Uredi - Vnos v kazalo\"\>\<emph\>Uredi - Vnos v kazalo\</emph\>\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
